        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/858c86/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-04T03:48:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Does anybody have any tips for unlocking the Horus of Two Horizons Ra variant? It's a really tough balance to keep him high enough health that he can take the damage from solar flare, but low enough that the Ennead can get the incap. Plus the last time I tried they drew The Grave Beckons (Destroy non-villain targets under 3 HP\" which counts differently than being incapped so I ended up not getting the variant. I'm having a tough time figuring out conceptually if there's an easier way to do it. I'm saving solar flare for my last Ra play so that I can control his HP a little better... does it just come down to luck of the draw at that point, and hoping the Ennead draws the right card to incap?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Thanks. I tried searching the forums and found the original unlock thread, but not a lot in terms of strategy for achieving the unlock conditions.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:51.596Z",
