        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-04T04:05:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Team Leader Tachyon should be your first choice in any fight that doesn't require her to sit the game out.<br><br>Visionary's base power is great for getting Ra's cards into his hands.<br><br>Legacy and Nightmist are great since Take Down and Mistbound both shut down the Ennead for an entire round.</p>",
