      {
        "id": 164725,
        "name": "jorgenp",
        "username": "jorgenp",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-04T04:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Although it's a little cheaty, have Ra as the last hero to act.&nbsp; That way, you can see what The Ennead will do.&nbsp; If the cards they played will incap Ra, rewind time to Ra's turn and play Solar Flare.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You might even have Ra damage himself just enough to prepare the Ennead to finish him off.</p>",
