        "raw": "<p>Although it&#39;s a little cheaty, have Ra as the last hero to act.&nbsp; That way, you can see what The Ennead will do.&nbsp; If the cards they played will incap Ra, rewind time to Ra&#39;s turn and play Solar Flare.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You might even have Ra damage himself just enough to prepare the Ennead to finish him off.</p>",
