      {
        "id": 164727,
        "name": "saykhia",
        "username": "saykhia",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saykhia/{size}/2132_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-04T06:09:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This variant has similar challenges as the DW Fixer one (although I struggled much more with the DW Fixer, partially because of the lesser number of heroes to choose from at the time).</p>\n<p>For such unlocks I suggest Dark Visionary as first hero followed by Ra, Argent Adept, Nightmist and a nuker hero (Wraith is pretty good, for its directed damage + utility/control potential).</p>\n<p>Get Ra set-up with everything except Solar Flare. Dark Visionary scout and stack Ennead’s deck, keep Ra’s HP somewhere safe but not too high. Keep environment play area as clear as possible.</p>\n<p>Set Nightmist up to take the final damage, with amulet ready.</p>\n<p>When Dark Visionary sees the right card is ready, Ra damages himself to the point of almost-death, Argent Adept plays Solar Flare for Ra and Nightmist Mistbinds the environment. Final hero to do other things (e.g continue damaging Ra) if required.</p>\n<p>Ennead hits Nightmist, redirects to Ra.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:45:59.218Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
