        "created_at": "2016-03-04T18:38:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"grysqrl\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/48/1909_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> grysqrl:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>One thing that might help is to have folks who can redirect damage around. Nightmist and Tachyon can help to make sure that killing blow lands on Ra, even if he wasn't the initial target.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This. &nbsp;It's also how I got The Operative to incapacitate Fixer when I had to re-do the achievement on my tablet. &nbsp;Synaptic Interruption aren Amulet of the Elder Gods are fantastic when you need someone to damage someone they normally wouldn't.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:45:59.364Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
