        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I got it this afternoon! Used a team of TL Tachyon, Nightmist, Dark Visionary, Tempest, and Ra. I forgot that once Atum goes down you can&#39;t stack the villain deck any more, so that threw some more uncertainty into things. Worked ok though, I was using Tachyon (Synaptic Interruption) and Nightmist&#39;s amulet to redirect damage, and Visionary to control the Final Wasteland down the stretch to make sure nothing unexpected popped out of the environment to kill Ra. Isis finally finished off Ra to get me the variant.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the tips!</p>",
